    "text": "I see your point, but some discussions work better in person.",
    "duration": 5.976,
    "src": "/audio/english/conversation-25-line-2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "conversation-25-line-3",
    "voice": "Iapetus",
    "text": "Which discussions do you have in mind?",
    "duration": 2.808,
    "src": "/audio/english/conversation-25-line-3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "conversation-25-line-4",
    "voice": "Erinome",
    "text": "Sensitive feedback and team planning.",
    "duration": 3.648,
    "src": "/audio/english/conversation-25-line-4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "conversation-26-line-1",
    "voice": "Iapetus",
    "text": "The only solution is to hire more staff.",
    "duration": 4.416,
    "src": "/audio/english/conversation-26-line-1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "conversation-26-line-2",
    "voice": "Erinome",
    "text": "Have we considered improving the booking system first?",
    "duration": 4.464,
    "src": "/audio/english/conversation-26-line-2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "conversation-26-line-3",
    "voice": "Iapetus",
    "text": "How would that help?",
    "duration": 1.776,
    "src": "/audio/english/conversation-26-line-3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "conversation-26-line-4",
    "voice": "Erinome",
    "text": "It could reduce the time spent on routine tasks.",
    "duration": 4.848,
    "src": "/audio/english/conversation-26-line-4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "conversation-27-line-1",
    "voice": "Iapetus",
    "text": "Should we move the course online?",
    "duration": 3.024,
    "src": "/audio/english/conversation-27-line-1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "conversation-27-line-2",
    "voice": "Erinome",
    "text": "On the one hand, it is flexible; on the other hand, some learners need classroom support.",
    "duration": 7.464,
    "src": "/audio/english/conversation-27-line-2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "conversation-27-line-3",
    "voice": "Iapetus",
    "text": "Could we offer both formats?",
    "duration": 2.808,
    "src": "/audio/english/conversation-27-line-3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "conversation-27-line-4",
    "voice": "Erinome",
    "text": "Yes, a mixed approach might work.",
    "duration": 4.104,
    "src": "/audio/english/conversation-27-line-4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "conversation-28-line-1",
    "voice": "Iapetus",
    "text": "We need the whole budget for advertising.",
    "duration": 3.888,
    "src": "/audio/english/conversation-28-line-1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "conversation-28-line-2",
    "voice": "Erinome",
    "text": "What if we split it between advertising and training?",
