    "src": "/audio/english/conversation-28-line-2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "conversation-28-line-3",
    "voice": "Iapetus",
    "text": "I could agree to that if we review the results next month.",
    "duration": 5.064,
    "src": "/audio/english/conversation-28-line-3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "conversation-28-line-4",
    "voice": "Erinome",
    "text": "That seems fair.",
    "duration": 2.184,
    "src": "/audio/english/conversation-28-line-4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "conversation-29-line-1",
    "voice": "Iapetus",
    "text": "What will your presentation cover?",
    "duration": 2.856,
    "src": "/audio/english/conversation-29-line-1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "conversation-29-line-2",
    "voice": "Erinome",
    "text": "I will outline the problem, compare two options, and recommend a solution.",
    "duration": 7.008,
    "src": "/audio/english/conversation-29-line-2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "conversation-29-line-3",
    "voice": "Iapetus",
    "text": "How will you involve the audience?",
    "duration": 3.024,
    "src": "/audio/english/conversation-29-line-3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "conversation-29-line-4",
    "voice": "Erinome",
    "text": "I will begin with a short question.",
    "duration": 3.288,
    "src": "/audio/english/conversation-29-line-4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "conversation-30-line-1",
    "voice": "Iapetus",
    "text": "The new design is more accessible.",
    "duration": 3.504,
    "src": "/audio/english/conversation-30-line-1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "conversation-30-line-2",
    "voice": "Erinome",
    "text": "Could you explain what you mean by accessible in this context?",
    "duration": 5.328,
    "src": "/audio/english/conversation-30-line-2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "conversation-30-line-3",
    "voice": "Iapetus",
    "text": "The text is easier to read, and the buttons work with a keyboard.",
    "duration": 5.208,
    "src": "/audio/english/conversation-30-line-3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "conversation-30-line-4",
    "voice": "Erinome",
    "text": "Thank you. That makes it clearer.",
    "duration": 2.976,
    "src": "/audio/english/conversation-30-line-4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "conversation-31-line-1",
    "voice": "Iapetus",
    "text": "Tell us about a difficult project.",
    "duration": 3.504,
    "src": "/audio/english/conversation-31-line-1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "conversation-31-line-2",
    "voice": "Erinome",
    "text": "Although we missed the first deadline, we used the feedback to improve the final result.",
    "duration": 6.624,
    "src": "/audio/english/conversation-31-line-2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "conversation-31-line-3",
    "voice": "Iapetus",
    "text": "What did you learn from it?",
    "duration": 2.328,
    "src": "/audio/english/conversation-31-line-3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "conversation-31-line-4",
    "voice": "Erinome",
    "text": "To test our assumptions earlier.",
    "duration": 3.528,
    "src": "/audio/english/conversation-31-line-4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "conversation-32-line-1",
    "voice": "Iapetus",
    "text": "How would you sum up the discussion?",
